.DS_Store
.build/
dist/
tmp/
output/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Local delivery and progress notes are not part of the scientific artifact.
COMPLETION_AUDIT.md
FINAL_REPORT.md
PROGRESS.md

# The working directory can contain exploratory runs. The initial public commit
# force-adds only the 115 run IDs named by aggregate.json.
benchmark-results/*
!benchmark-results/aggregate.json
!benchmark-results/README.md

# Real-model exploratory outputs remain local; only the recorded aggregate
# and its human-readable interpretation are scientific evidence.
real-llm-results/*
!real-llm-results/aggregate.json
!real-llm-results/README.md
